  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "Appending zeros does not change a decimal's value. Give each number four decimal places and compare digits from left to right:\n\\[\n0.9070<0.9089<0.9700<0.9709<0.9790.\n\\]\nTherefore the largest number is \\(\\boxed{0.979}\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
